# xbuild's runtime_libs folder for arm64-v8a (crates/rustudio-android/manifest.yaml):
# tools/android/fetch-turnip.sh puts libadrenotools.so, its hook libraries,
# libvulkan_freedreno.so (the Turnip driver, for Adreno) and
# libvulkan_panfrost.so (the PanVK driver, for Mali; PANVK=0 leaves it out)
# here before `x build`. The .so files are git-ignored; an empty folder
# builds a plain APK.
